<title>CHINA: Steel Tube reverses losses in 1996.</title>
<headline>Steel Tube reverses losses in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	529.468	 vs	    511.990</p>
<p> Net profit	5.425	 vs	     (9.043)</p>
<p> Net assets per share     2.29 yuan  vs  2.27 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.02 yuan  vs (0.03) yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Steel Tube Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed not to issue a cash dividend or bonus shares, pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the statement said.</p>
</text>
